- progressive: {"environmentKey":"production","releaseType":"override","override":{"releaseMethod":"progressive","rolloutContextKindKey":"user","stages":[{"allocation":10000,"durationMillis":3600000},{"allocation":100000,"durationMillis":3600000}]}}
- guarded: {"environmentKey":"production","releaseType":"override","override":{"releaseMethod":"guarded","rolloutContextKindKey":"user","stages":[{"allocation":10000,"durationMillis":3600000}],"metricKeys":["error-rate"],"rollbackOnRegression":true}}
- policy with a named environment release plan, which always needs releaseType policy: {"environmentKey":"production","releaseType":"policy","environmentReleasePlanKey":"prod-ramp"}
